   "titulo": "Transport",
   "texto": [
    "Трамвай (tram), троллейбус (trolebus) and велосипед (bike) are means of transport. Пассажир is passenger and пешеход, pedestrian.",
    "Ехать (еду) expresses a concrete journey in a direction; ездить (ездит) usually expresses regular or repeated movements.",
    "For the means of transport is used на + prepositional: на трамвае, на велосипеде. For the destination it can be used на + acusativa: на работу."
   ]
